    spike(c11v): send PTY resize 40 ms after the last size change
    
    Ghostty reflows up to 25 ms after set_size; an immediate TIOCSWINSZ let vim
    redraw onto the old grid.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

