Author: Atin <ops@demo.lan>
Date:   Tue Oct 27 21:24:33 2026 -0700

    A project agents.json selects the agent, model and effort only (#757)
    
    * C11-483 P2: restrict project agent config to model and effort
    
    Keep commands, environment and prompts sourced from operator Settings across every launch resolver. Validate project choices, disclose ignored fields, and cover malicious repo configuration through discovery and launch composition.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
    
    * C11-483 P2: translate the project agent config caption
    
    Replace settings.defaultAgent.note with settings.defaultAgent.projectChoicesNote
    in all six locales.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * C11-483 P2: constrain repo choices across shells
    
    Restrict project model and effort to bounded ASCII tokens and detect operator flags only in the trusted base command. Derive best-effort ignored-field disclosure from the decoded entry and document the contract.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
    
    * C11-483 P2: reject equals in project choices
    
    Block zsh MAGIC_EQUAL_SUBST inputs and pin operator-only launch rendering for Claude, Codex, Pi and omp flag styles.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>
    
