[33mcommit d1be3343a0c11c7a3186b921ba6199c83e390e68[m
Author: Atin <ops@demo.lan>
Date:   Mon Oct 26 20:35:56 2026 -0700

    Reject malformed blueprints instead of trapping (#758)
    
    Duplicate panel ids, non-finite split ratios and deep YAML or JSON nesting are refused with an error instead of trapping c11; blueprint reads are size-capped, JSON blueprints must be UTF-8, and workspace.apply plans get the same nesting bound. Phase 3 of C11-483.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

