Author: Atin <ops@demo.lan>
Date:   Mon Oct 26 19:49:11 2026 -0700

    Bound favicon fetch and decode, and move them off the main actor (#759)
    
    Favicon fetches are http(s) only, streamed under a 1 MiB cap and 4 s deadline, and decoded off the main actor through an ImageIO raster allowlist with header size checks. Phase 4 of C11-483.
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

