[33mcommit 42db7253e4f1fff1937abaf1243da2c318d0dbf7[m
Author: Atin <ops@demo.lan>
Date:   Sat Oct 24 04:33:53 2026 -0700

    Pin the test's workspace manager in the agent-PID attention tests (#746)
    
    AppDelegate.setActiveMainWindow runs on the main queue that drainMainQueue()
    drains and calls setActiveWorkspaceManager, which swapped the test's manager
    for the app's mid-test: the PID then registered on no workspace (nil) or the
    next lookup failed (Tab not found). A DEBUG-only pin keeps the test's manager
    in place until the test restores it. Product code is unaffected: the async
    registration already falls back to the window that owns the workspace.
    
    Co-authored-by: Atin <operator.at.work@example.com>
    Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

